      en: ["Total length of 116.5 kilometers", "Upper reaches are known as the Wipper", "Elevation drop of 407 meters from source to mouth", "Suspension railway runs over the river for 10 km", "A total of 15 dams in the catchment area", "Catchment area size: 813 square kilometers"],
